      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REGAL ROCK NZ (6) kicked off the campaign with two solid efforts before delivering in style last week, coming from this barrier to cruise home by nearly 11m at Echuca. At peak fitness so could strike again. KIMCHI (4) has led and fought on well for second in his last two outings, missing narrowly at Stawell before he was 1.2m off the winner at this circuit and distance last week. Draws to push forward and could be hard to catch. WINGATE GUY (10) may need some luck from the back row but he is racing well, toughing out a narrow win over KIMCHI two back before missing by a nose last week. SKYZ ABOVE (5) is worth some thought after her last-start fourth at this venue.",
